{
  "description": "OLS 對帳結果查詢（SRS 4.5）。目前只為 US-COM-01 提供登入後查詢有資料的預設回應。",
  "routes": [
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "sa/report/reconDaily",
      "documentation": "SRS 4.5 每日對帳結果",
